  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover Rothco&rsquo;s Vintage Canvas Compact Backpack, built with a compact yet feature-packed design for optimal storage. The main compartment features a two-way zipper closure for quick, full access to your everyday carry essentials. The military style travel backpack has a 24L capacity and measures 15 inch x 13.5 inch x 7 inch, providing ample storage space for your EDC gear.</p>",
